# JNLisp CFD Linalg Package

- Author: Jed Nelson
- Date: 27/11/25

Linear algebra for solving CFD.

j(ns jnl.cfd.linalg)


## Solvers

Creates Jacobi preconditioned conjugate gradient solver with max iterations and
tolerance.
j(defn make-solver [ncells max-iters tol]
  (.make-jacobi-cg ncells max-iters tol))

j(defn make-simple-solver [ncells max-iters tol]
  (.make-simple-cg ncells max-iters tol))
